       2048,
       1520
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "stop announcing your plans"
     ],
     "texte": "aprende [[fotografía]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "telling everyone your goals can give you a hit of",
      "dopamine before you've actually done anything"
     ],
     "texte": "luz, encuadre, el momento justo: cada foto te enseña a [[ver lo que todos ignoran]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "you get to feel",
      "ambitious, receive",
      "praise, and imagine",
      "the end result",
      "without putting in",
      "the work"
     ],
     "texte": "en un estudio, mayores que aprendieron foto durante 3 meses [[mejoraron más su memoria]] que quienes solo socializaban"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "stop talking about what you're going to do. disappear,",
      "put your head down, and let your results speak for you"
     ],
     "texte": "no hace falta un gran equipo, con el móvil basta para empezar, se trata de [[aprender a mirar]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0a28ab50.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "read books instead of scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "aprende [[otro idioma]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "a book makes you follow one idea for pages.",
      "scrolling trains that out of your head"
     ],
     "texte": "palabras nuevas, otra gramática: tu cerebro [[alterna entre dos sistemas]] todo el día"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "if you want to think",
      "deeper, give your brain",
      "something long before",
      "anything short"
     ],
     "texte": "en personas bilingües, los síntomas de demencia aparecen [[unos 4 años más tarde]] de media"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i use readup which blocks",
      "my apps until i read for 20",
      "minutes, which stopps me",
      "from scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "hoy por fin entendí por qué el cielo es azul, en 5 min con [[la app Sophia]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture",
